   "text": "<answer>\nAdjacency list:\n- main.py: [api.py, db.py, auth.py, config.py]\n- api.py: [db.py, auth.py, models.py, utils.py]\n- db.py: [config.py, models.py]\n- auth.py: [db.py, config.py, utils.py]\n- models.py: [config.py]\n- utils.py: []\n- config.py: []\n\n1. Topological order (dependencies first):\n   config.py \u2192 utils.py \u2192 models.py \u2192 db.py \u2192 auth.py \u2192 api.py \u2192 main.py\n\n2. Module with the most dependents:\n   config.py \u2014 5 direct dependents.\n\n3. Circular dependencies:\n   None.\n\n4. Modules affected by a change to config.py (transitively):\n   models.py, db.py, auth.py, api.py, main.py\n</answer>",
